      56.13,
      398.17,
      547.23,
      493.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1567/23 of September 19, 2008 (as lastamended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1909/21 of April 07, 2015), which specifies the Facultiesand the Departments of the University of Ruhuna, Sri Lanka, which is deemed by virtue of the provisions of Section 139of the aforesaid Act, to be a University established under Section 21 of the said Act, by the substitution for the item\u201cDepartment of Limnology\u201d appearing in Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Fisheriesand Marine Sciences and Technology\u201d appearing in Column I of the Schedule of the following item :-",
